  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "38806001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "有植物的气味，铃兰、橡树，还有……这是新扩建的植物温室？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "|101|是怎么知道我正准备筹建新温室……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38806004",
              "text": "我也可以听见菲伊的心声了。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "38806004",
              "text": "因为我听见了菲伊的心愿哦。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38806003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……给「失败品」投资并不明智，空虚的生命什么都不会留下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这不是投资，菲伊也不是「失败品」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是我和你的「约定」哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "「约定」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "菲伊答应要教我照顾植物的方法，对吧？那温室就是我们「约定」的证明了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "对，但是单纯因为这个就弄个温室……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "更重要的是，只要有和我的约定在，菲伊就不会是空虚的生命哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你已经在世界上留下了存在的证明。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我存在的……证明……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "菲伊会一直存在于我的记忆与未来，当然植物们肯定也是这么想的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "谢谢……愿意让我停留在大家的生命中……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那我们明天就一起来给植物们浇水吧，我很期待！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……原来这就是「期待」……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38806017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我也很期待，期待明天与你的相遇。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
